@startuml scheduling-domain
!include _style.puml
title Scheduling Domain

class Booking <<Aggregate Root>> #FFF1E6 {
  +Id: UUID
  +StudentId: UUID
  +TutorId: UUID
  +Slot: TimeSlot
  +Status: BookingStatus
  +ConfirmFromHold()
  +Cancel(actor, reason)
}
class TimeSlot <<Value Object>> {
  +StartAtUtc: instant
  +EndAtUtc: instant
  +Overlaps(): bool
}
enum BookingStatus {
  Confirmed
  Cancelled
}
class BookingConfirmed <<Domain Event>>
class BookingCancelled <<Domain Event>>
class OutboxMessage <<Persistence Model>>

Booking *-- TimeSlot
Booking --> BookingStatus
Booking ..> BookingConfirmed : raises
Booking ..> BookingCancelled : raises
BookingConfirmed ..> OutboxMessage : maps after transaction
BookingCancelled ..> OutboxMessage : maps after transaction
note bottom of Booking
Hold nằm trong Redis, không phải Entity của Booking aggregate.
PostgreSQL exclusion constraint bảo vệ Tutor và Student overlap.
end note
@enduml

